<title>JAPAN: Nippon Sharyo to issue 10 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Nippon Sharyo to issue 10 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Nippon Sharyo Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Yamaichi Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Tokai Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   4	  AMT   10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 30.Sep.04</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Aug.97   CONV TO 29.Sep.04</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 16.Jul.97  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 9.Jul-15.Jul</p>
<p> LAST JCR   A-	  LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on July 8.</p>
</text>
